= Ignacy Daszyński

Daszyński represents Centrum PPS and specializes in parliamentary negotiation.

- @parliamentary_compromise
- @broker_coalition
- @root: Return to main

@parliamentary_compromise
title: Parliamentary Compromise
subtitle: Improve relations with potential parliamentary partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; psl_piast_relation += 3; npr_relation += 3; pschd_relation += 2

Daszyński opens discussions with PSL Piast, NPR and PSChD.

@broker_coalition
title: Broker a Coalition
subtitle: Reduce tension inside the governing coalition.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and spd_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next adviser action. ?][? if spd_in_government = 0 : The PPS is not in government. ?][? if coalition_dissent <= 0 : The coalition has no current dissent to resolve. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1

The immediate coalition dispute has been contained.
